  "description": "Seol-ryeon uses her beauty as a weapon to win the affections of countless men and maintains her self-esteem through it. She feels that among all of the men, none of them were capable of captivating her. Then, the perfect man of her dreams, Park Kang-sik, appeared before her. She starts to become interested in him, and won't let Minhye Kim, who was already interested in him first, take the situation for granted. Soon the two of them begin to fight over Park Kang-sik...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%84%A4%EB%A0%A8%ED%99%94/3785), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/62942249)",
